    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibyo Imana ishaka ku bantu bayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noneho nimwumve icyo Uwiteka avuga ati “Haguruka uburanire imbere y'imisozi, udusozi twumve ijwi ryawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwa misozi mwe, namwe mfatiro z'isi zitajegajega, nimwumve kuburana k'Uwiteka, kuko Uwiteka afitanye urubanza n'ubwoko bwe kandi azaburana na Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yewe bwoko bwanjye nakugize nte? Icyo nakuruhijeho ni iki? Ukimpamye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.10+EXO.4.11+EXO.4.12+EXO.4.13+EXO.4.14+EXO.4.15+EXO.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 4.10-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.50+EXO.12.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.50-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.15.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nakuzamuye nkuvana mu gihugu cya Egiputa, ndakurokora ngukura mu nzu y'uburetwa, nohereza Mose na Aroni na Miriyamu imbere yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kub 22.2—24.25; Yos 3.1—4.19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yemwe mwa bwoko bwanjye, noneho mwibuke icyo Balaki umwami w'i Mowabu yagambiriye, n'icyo Balāmu mwene Bewori yamushubije. Mwibuke uhereye i Shitimu ukageza i Gilugali, kugira ngo mumenye ibyo gukiranuka Uwiteka yakoze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbese nditwara ku Uwiteka, ngapfukamira Imana isumba byose nyituye iki? Nayitwaraho njyanye ibitambo byoswa n'inyana zimaze umwaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Uwiteka yakwemera amapfizi y'intama ibihumbi, cyangwa imigezi y'amavuta ya elayo inzovu? Ese natanga imfura yanjye ku gicumuro cyanjye, imbuto y'umubiri wanjye nkayihonga ku cyaha cy'ubugingo bwanjye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yewe mwana w'umuntu we, yakweretse icyiza icyo ari cyo. Icyo Uwiteka agushakaho ni iki? Ni ugukora ibyo gukiranuka no gukunda kubabarira, no kugendana n'Imana yawe wicisha bugufi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijwi ry'Uwiteka rirangurura ribwira umurwa, kandi umunyabwenge azubaha izina ryawe riti “Nimwumvire inkoni ihana n'uwayitegetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbese ubutunzi budatunganye buracyari mu nzu y'inkozi z'ibibi cyangwa ingero zitubya, abantu banga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafite iminzani ibeshya n'uruhago rurimo ibipimisho bihenda, mbese bantunganira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko abakire baho buzuye urugomo kandi abaturage baho bavuga ibinyoma, n'ururimi rwabo rwo mu kanwa kabo rukariganya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo gituma nanjye naguteje igikomere kibabaje, nkugira umusaka nguhoye ibyaha byawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzarya we guhaga n'iwawe hazabamo ubusa, uzabijyana ariko ntuzabisohoza amahoro, kandi icyo uzahakura nzagitsembesha inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzabiba ariko ntuzasarura, uzenga imbuto z'imyelayo ariko ntuzisīga amavuta yazo, uzenga imizabibu ariko ntuzanywa vino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.23+1KI.16.24+1KI.16.25+1KI.16.26+1KI.16.27+1KI.16.28+1KI.16.29+1KI.16.30+1KI.16.31+1KI.16.32+1KI.16.33+1KI.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 16.23-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.25+1KI.21.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.25-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kuko amategeko ya Omuri n'ibyakozwe n'umuryango wa Ahabu byose bikomezwa, namwe mugakurikiza imigenzo yabo, bigatuma nkugira umusaka n'abaturage baho bakabimyoza, kandi muzagerekwaho n'igitutsi batuka ubwoko bwanjye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
